ion\\n\",","    \"\\n\",","    \"## 1. Introduction and objective\\n\",","    \"\\n\",","    \"**Research question Q1:** How do major events in Canton Zürich affect daily POS card spending across merchant categories compared with similar non-event days?\\n\",","    \"\\n\",","    \"**Data** (prepared in Notebook 02):\\n\",","    \"* **Events:** seven editions, five Street Parades (one day each) and two Züri Fäscht editions (three days each).\\n\",","    \"* **Categories:** Food and beverage services, Accommodation and Transport services.\\n\",","    \"\\n\",","    \"**Approach**\\n\",","    \"1. **Baseline:** for every day around an event we estimate typical spending as the median of comparable non-event days (same weekday, within ±28 days).\\n\",","    \"2. **Deviation:** each day is compared with its baseline as a percentage deviation, separately for spending and for the number of transactions.\\n\",","    \"3. **Visualization:** one six-panel figure per event, an event-day heatmap, a summary table and two sensitivity checks.\\n\",","    \"\\n\",","    \"**Day 0** is the Street Parade day, or the Saturday of Züri Fäscht (Friday = −1, Sunday = +1). It only aligns the editions in time; it is not the baseline.\\n\",","    \"\\n\",","    \"All results are descriptive comparisons, not proof that an event caused a change in spending.\"","   ]","  },","  {","   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",","   \"id\": \"8407ffe7\",","   \"metadata\": {},","   \"source\": [","    \"## 2. Imports and file paths\\n\",","    \"\\n\",","    \"The notebook is run from the project folder. It reads three files from Notebook 02 and writes figures to `figures/`; no other files are changed.\"","   ]","  },","  {","   \"cell_type\": \"code\",","   \"execution_count\": 1,","   \"id\": \"742d693f\",","   \"metadata\": {","    \"execution\": {","     \"iopub.execute_input\": \"2026-11-01T16:44:07.859733Z\",","     \"iopub.status.busy\": \"2026-11-01T16:44:07.859440Z\",","     \"iopub.status.idle\": \"2026-11-01T16:44:09.132006Z\",","     \"shell.execute_reply\": \"2026-11-01T16:44:09.130706Z\"","    }","   },","   \"outputs\": [],","   \"source\": [","    \"from pathlib import Path\\n\",","    \"\\n\",","    \"import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\\n\",","    \"import numpy as np\\n\",","    \"import pandas as pd\\n\",","    \"import seaborn as sns\\n\",","    \"from dateutil.easter import easter\\n\",","    \"from matplotlib.lines import Line2D\\n\",","    \"\\n\",","    \"DATA_DIR = Path(\\\"data/processed\\\")\\n\",","    \"FIGURE_DIR = Path(\\\"figures\\\")\\n\",","    \"FIGURE_DIR.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\\n\",","    \"\\n\",","    \"SPENDING_FILE = DATA_DIR / \\\"q1_spending_zurich_clean.csv\\\"\\n\",","    \"EDITIONS_FILE = DATA_DIR / \\\"q1_event_editions_clean.csv\\\"\\n\",","    \"INTEGRATED_FILE = DATA_DIR / \\\"q1_event_spending_integrated.csv\\\"\\n\",","    \"\\n\",","    \"for path in [SPENDING_FILE, EDITIONS_FILE, INTEGRATED_FILE]:\\n\",","    \"    if not path.exists():\\n\",","    \"        raise FileNotFoundError(f\\\"Missing input file: {path}. Run Notebook 02 first and start this notebook \\\"\\n\",","    \"                                \\\"from the project folder.\\\")\\n\",","    \"\\n\",","    \"CATEGORIES = [\\\"Food and beverage services\\\", \\\"Accommodation\\\", \\\"Transport services\\\"]\\n\",","    \"MIN_CONTROLS = 3      # a baseline needs at least three comparison days\"","   ]","  },","  {","   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",","   \"id\": \"7b368121\",","   \"metadata\": {},","   \"source\": [","    \"## 3. Data loading and basic validation\\n\",","    \"\\n\",","    \"Before any calculation we check that the files have the expected size, contain all seven editions and eleven event days, and have no missing values or duplicate rows.\"","   ]","  },","  {","   \"cell_type\": \"code\",","   \"execution_count\": 2,","   \"id\": \"3ac6a72b\",","   \"metadata\": {","    \"execution\": {","     \"iopub.execute_input\": \"2026-11-0